  "key_observations_html": "<div style=\"border:1px solid #C7D8E8;border-radius:10px;padding:0.75rem 0.95rem;margin:0.1rem 0 0.55rem;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);\"><ul style=\"margin:0.1rem 0 0 1.05rem;padding:0;color:#1F4C67;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.45;\"><li><strong>Tokenized stocks distributed value rose 11.5% over 30D:</strong> Tokenized equity distributed value at $3.52B (11.5% higher over 30D) shows the early lane still adding balance sheet on a small set of platforms. Related: <a href=\"https://cointelegraph.com/news/nasdaq-companies-object-tokenized-stock-listings-okx-ice?utm_source=rss_feed&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Wells Fargo and five others object to OKX-ICE tokenized stock listings: Report</a> (CoinTelegraph).</li><li><strong>Tokenized stocks remain an early-stage lane:</strong> liquidity and scale are still concentrated in a small set of platforms/networks. Related: <a href=\"https://www.coindesk.com/business/2026/10/24/wells-fargo-cisco-marvell-among-latest-firms-objecting-to-okxice-s-tokenized-stock-plan\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Wells Fargo, Cisco, Marvell among latest firms objecting to OKXICE&#x27;s tokenized stock plan</a> (CoinDesk).</li><li><strong>Tokenized equities remain an early access market:</strong> Liquidity and scale stay concentrated until broker distribution and custody plumbing can support broader trading. Related: <a href=\"https://www.coindesk.com/business/2026/10/23/why-mcdonalds-microsoft-and-google-saying-no-to-tokenized-stocks-isn-t-a-dealbreaker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Why McDonalds, Microsoft and Google saying no to tokenized stocks isn&#x27;t a dealbreaker</a> (CoinDesk).</li><li><strong>Regulatory framing still decides product access:</strong> Securities and broker-rule constraints often set the pace more than listing count, so near-term share stays tied to venues that can actually distribute products. Related: <a href=\"https://www.theblock.co/news/business/2026-10-26-aviva-investors-ripple-tokenized-share-class-sterling-fund-xrp-ledger-431712\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Aviva Investors, Ripple launch tokenized share class of $29 billion sterling fund on XRP Ledger</a> (The Block).</li></ul><p class=\"takeaways__note\">Context only\u2014not investment advice. Bullets combine on-page data with recent industry headlines.</p></div><p class=\"review-note ko-disclaimer\">Key observations are AI generated and should be reviewed for accuracy.</p>",
